    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Le maire de Lyon, Paul Th\u00e9raneau, est dans une position d\u00e9licate. Apr\u00e8s 30 ans en politique, il est \u00e0 cours d\u2019id\u00e9es, sentant comme un vide existentiel. Pour y pallier, Paul engage une jeune et brillante philosophe, Alice Heimann. S\u2019ensuit un dialogue entre deux personnalit\u00e9s diam\u00e9tralement oppos\u00e9es, qui chamboulera leurs certitudes.",
        "english": "The mayor of Lyon, Paul Th\u00e9raneau, is in a bad way. He has run out of ideas. After thirty years in politics, he feels empty. To solve this problem, his team decides to hire a brilliant young philosopher, Alice Heimann. A dialogue between Alice and the mayor unfolds, bringing them together and shaking their certainties."
